2. DATA AND DERIVED ARTEFACTS  --  CC BY 4.0
================================================================================

Applies to the measurements and generated text this work produced:

  allele_library.json                the 32 authored allele strings
  results/brute_force/               the 4,096-genome oracle
  results/evolution/                 convergence traces and evaluation caches
  results/analysis/                  derived tables
  results/full_test/                 held-out test summaries
  the label column and per-class ordering of validation_items.csv

