================================================================================
3. THIRD-PARTY CONTENT  --  NOT relicensed by the above
================================================================================

This release redistributes small excerpts of two public datasets, only to the
extent needed to make the validation probe and the five-shot demonstrations
reproducible. Nothing in sections 1 and 2 grants any right over this content;
it remains under the terms of its original providers, and those terms govern
any further redistribution:

  - The review sentences in validation_items.csv (250 items) and the five
    demonstrations in FEWSHOT_EXAMPLES in code/evolution/evaluate_full_test.py
    come from the Stanford Sentiment Treebank (SST-5), obtained via the
    SetFit/sst5 mirror on Hugging Face.
      Socher et al., "Recursive Deep Models for Semantic Compositionality Over
      a Sentiment Treebank," EMNLP 2013.

  - The five demonstrations in YELP_FEWSHOT_EXAMPLES in the same file are
    reviews from the Yelp Open Dataset, governed by the Yelp Dataset Terms of
    Use. These ten lines are the only Yelp review text in this release; all
    Yelp-5 results here are aggregate scores, with no per-item review text.
      https://www.yelp.com/dataset/terms

Model weights are not redistributed. The scripts download them from Hugging
Face, and each model remains subject to its own licence (for example the Llama
Community License for the Llama models).


